  "notes": "Adds a bounded 32-byte cooler output-route snapshot to explicit cached diagnostics without changing actuator, admission, current-compensation or fault policies. All 37 focused host suites, independent review, normal PlatformIO build and actual I2C ELF/map audit passed. USB installation, normal startup, connected Twin Button and unchanged 64-row flashlight learning data were verified. The startup test captured GPIO46 routed to ordinary GPIO (selector 256) instead of LEDC channel 5 (selector 78), while LEDC duty remained 255 and measured cooler delta was 0.1 mA. This identifies a software routing defect for the next correction; this diagnostic release does not claim the cooler or primary IR fault repaired. Existing faults remain visible and final sampled outputs are off.",
